WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
What to carry forward.

2
00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:04.995
Three habits from this lesson run through the rest of the studio.

3
00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:10.309
Define output shape once, as a Pydantic model, and generate everything else from it.

4
00:00:10.589 --> 00:00:17.267
Make choices about required, nullable, and closed explicit, because each one changes what a failure looks like.

5
00:00:17.547 --> 00:00:22.688
And always validate, then decide what happens to failures instead of letting them slide through.

6
00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:25.784
Validation tells you the output has the right shape.

7
00:00:26.064 --> 00:00:30.075
It says nothing about whether the owner, the date, or the task is correct.

8
00:00:30.355 --> 00:00:35.560
Lesson 8 makes the right shape nearly automatic; lesson 9 deals with whether it’s true.
